    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlendīnārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a mill, mill-</i>
			(post-class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">molendinariae metae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 17, 4, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">molendinaria meta (al. molendaria),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 33, 7, 18, § 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlen-dīnārĭus</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>a miller</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 1114, 6</span></i>.</div>
